abstract: >
  A structured mapping between Service-Oriented Architecture (SOA) concepts
  and their Agentic AI equivalents, offered as a starting vocabulary for the
  agentic enterprise. Twenty-eight mapped term pairs, published with a companion
  whitepaper on standardizing Agentic AI terminology.
